      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even a single dose of Advil can still pose significant risks when taken with Xarelto, as NSAIDs may increase bleeding time and block the intended effect of your blood thinner. Taking over-the-counter pain relievers without medical approval while on anticoagulants can create a dangerous situation even if taken only once or twice. Please prioritize your safety by calling your healthcare provider right away to discuss immediate, safe alternatives for managing your knee pain and swelling.",
